<h1>Poems and Songs</h1>
<poem><title>Evening</title>
<linegroup><line>The sun goes down behind the hill,</line><line>The fields are quiet, calm and still.</line></linegroup>
<linegroup><line>A single star begins to glow,</line><line>The river murmurs soft and low.</line></linegroup></poem>
<byline>Anonymous</byline>
<poem><title>Round the Garden</title>
<linegroup><line>Round and round the garden</line><line>Like a teddy bear;</line><line>One step, two step,</line><line>Tickle you under there.</line></linegroup></poem>
<p>Refrain:</p>
<poem><linegroup><line>Sing hey, sing ho,</line><line>Away we go.</line></linegroup></poem>
